<title>DENMARK: Danish August new car sales rose 5.2 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish August new car sales rose 5.2 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish new car registrations rose 5.2 percent in August to 10,401 from 9,884 a year earlier, the Automobile Importers' Society said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					Aug 1996    Aug 1995</p>
<p>    New car registrations	10,401	9,884</p>
<p>Leading August registrations by manufacturer</p>
<p>    Volkswagen AG	  1,463</p>
<p>    Toyota		   1,394</p>
<p>    General Motors Corp  1,016</p>
<p>    Ford Motor Co	    921</p>
<p>-- Copenhagen newsroom, +45-33-969650</p>
</text>
